    "AUTHOR"       — hunter1712, the original creator and copyright holder.

    "USER"         — Any person who downloads, installs, or runs the MOD.

    "MODPACK"      — A curated collection of mods distributed together as
                     a single pack, including but not limited to those on
                     CurseForge, Modrinth, or other launcher platforms.

    "MODIFICATION" — Any alteration to the MOD's source code, compiled
                     classes, assets, or configuration beyond normal use.

    "DERIVATIVE"   — A work based on or incorporating the MOD, including
                     modified versions, forks, ports, or partial extracts.

    "DISTRIBUTION" — Making the MOD available to others by any means,
