3.  MODPACK INCLUSION

    Including the MOD in a MODPACK is permitted under the following
    conditions:

    a)  The MODPACK is distributed exclusively through CurseForge,
        Modrinth, or an official launcher with which the AUTHOR has
        an active distribution agreement. Distribution on third-party
        mod-hosting sites, "mod repost" sites, or direct download links
        is expressly forbidden unless the AUTHOR has given written
        permission.

    b)  The USER must provide clear and prominent credit to the AUTHOR
        in the MODPACK description, including:
            i)   The MOD's name ("Infused Mobs")
            ii)  The AUTHOR's name ("hunter1712")
            iii) An easily accessible link to the MOD's official project
                 page on CurseForge or Modrinth.

    c)  The MODPACK's name and description must not be easily confused
        with the MOD's own name or branding.

    d)  Monetization of the MODPACK is permitted only through the
        standard monetization systems provided by CurseForge or Modrinth
        (e.g., sponsored links, banner ads on the project page). Any other
        form of monetization, including paywalled access, requires explicit
        written permission from the AUTHOR.

    e)  These permissions are non-transferrable, revocable at the AUTHOR's
        discretion, and apply only to the specific MODPACK for which they
        are exercised.

